{"id":"t1-jawi-kafa","tahap":"T1","nama":"Jawi (KAFA)","sk":"Jawi","ikon":"✍️","warna":"#B8862B","bahasa":"ms","kur":"KAFA Tahun 1 (ikut e-buku Jawi Tahun 1)","semak":"pending teacher review","jawi":true,"versi":"0.5.65","sumber":"Original notes and questions following the chapters of the owner's e-BOOK Jawi Tahun 1 (JAIS); Jawi examples in DBP spelling; shown in full Jawi.","topik":[{"id":"t1-jawi-kafa-1","nama":"Huruf Jawi","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Huruf Jawi"},{"j":"p","t":"Huruf Jawi ada <b>37</b> huruf. Huruf Jawi berasal daripada huruf Arab dan ditambah dengan huruf Melayu."},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">ا ب ت ة ث ج چ ح خ د ذ ر ز س ش ص ض ط ظ ع غ ڠ ف ڤ ق ك ݢ ل م ن و ۏ ه ء ي ى ڽ</span>"},{"j":"h","t":"Huruf tambahan Melayu"},{"j":"l","t":["<span class=\"arab\">چ</span> <span class=\"rm\">ca</span>","<span class=\"arab\">ڠ</span> <span class=\"rm\">nga</span>","<span class=\"arab\">ڤ</span> <span class=\"rm\">pa</span>","<span class=\"arab\">ݢ</span> <span class=\"rm\">ga</span>","<span class=\"arab\">ۏ</span> <span class=\"rm\">va</span>","<span class=\"arab\">ڽ</span> <span class=\"rm\">nya</span>"]},{"j":"h","t":"Tahukah anda?"},{"j":"l","t":["Huruf Jawi ditulis dari kanan ke kiri","Huruf <span class=\"arab\">ڽ</span> ialah huruf tambahan Melayu yang terakhir dicipta","Huruf <span class=\"arab\">ى</span> (<span class=\"rm\">ye</span>) ialah bunyi e taling di akhir perkataan","Belajar Jawi memudahkan kita membaca al-Quran"]}],"glosari":[["Huruf Jawi","Huruf Arab yang ditambah dengan huruf Melayu untuk menulis bahasa Melayu."],["Huruf tambahan","Huruf yang dicipta untuk bunyi Melayu yang tiada dalam bahasa Arab."],["Kanan ke kiri","Arah tulisan Jawi."]]},{"id":"t1-jawi-kafa-2","nama":"Penulisan huruf Jawi","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Bentuk huruf"},{"j":"p","t":"Huruf Jawi mempunyai beberapa bentuk mengikut kedudukannya dalam perkataan: <b>tunggal, awal, tengah dan akhir</b>."},{"j":"h","t":"Huruf yang tidak boleh disambung selepasnya"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">ا د ذ ر ز و ۏ ء</span> — huruf ini boleh bersambung dengan huruf sebelumnya, tetapi tidak dengan huruf selepasnya."},{"j":"h","t":"Contoh"},{"j":"l","t":["<span class=\"rm\">roda</span> → <span class=\"arab\">رودا</span>","<span class=\"rm\">daun</span> → <span class=\"arab\">داٴون</span>","<span class=\"rm\">arus</span> → <span class=\"arab\">اروس</span>"]},{"j":"h","t":"Huruf yang boleh disambung"},{"j":"p","t":"Huruf seperti <span class=\"arab\">ب ت ج س ك ل م ن</span> boleh disambung sebelum dan selepasnya."},{"j":"l","t":["<span class=\"rm\">nenek</span> → <span class=\"arab\">نينيق</span>","<span class=\"rm\">sifir</span> → <span class=\"arab\">سيفير</span>","<span class=\"rm\">leher</span> → <span class=\"arab\">ليهير</span>"]}],"glosari":[["Tunggal","Huruf yang berdiri sendiri."],["Awal","Huruf di depan perkataan."],["Tengah","Huruf di tengah perkataan."],["Akhir","Huruf di hujung perkataan."]]},{"id":"t1-jawi-kafa-3","nama":"Padanan huruf vokal","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Vokal dalam Jawi"},{"j":"l","t":["<span class=\"rm\">a</span> → <span class=\"arab\">ا</span>","<span class=\"rm\">i</span> dan <span class=\"rm\">e</span> taling → <span class=\"arab\">ي</span>","<span class=\"rm\">u</span> dan <span class=\"rm\">o</span> → <span class=\"arab\">و</span>","<span class=\"rm\">e</span> pepet tiada padanan huruf"]},{"j":"h","t":"Vokal di awal kata"},{"j":"l","t":["<span class=\"rm\">abu</span> → <span class=\"arab\">ابو</span>","<span class=\"rm\">ibu</span> → <span class=\"arab\">ايبو</span>","<span class=\"rm\">ubi</span> → <span class=\"arab\">اوبي</span>","<span class=\"rm\">oren</span> → <span class=\"arab\">اورين</span>","<span class=\"rm\">emas</span> → <span class=\"arab\">امس</span>","<span class=\"rm\">ekor</span> → <span class=\"arab\">ايكور</span>"]},{"j":"h","t":"Vokal di tengah kata"},{"j":"l","t":["<span class=\"rm\">batu</span> → <span class=\"arab\">باتو</span>","<span class=\"rm\">seru</span> → <span class=\"arab\">سرو</span>","<span class=