ak</span> → <span class=\"arab\">طمع</span>","<span class=\"rm\">h</span>: <span class=\"rm\">hati</span> → <span class=\"arab\">هاتي</span>, <span class=\"rm\">halal</span> → <span class=\"arab\">حلال</span>","<span class=\"rm\">k</span>: <span class=\"rm\">kasut</span> → <span class=\"arab\">كاسوت</span>, <span class=\"rm\">datuk</span> → <span class=\"arab\">داتوق</span>","<span class=\"rm\">s</span>: <span class=\"rm\">singa</span> → <span class=\"arab\">سيڠا</span>, <span class=\"rm\">solat</span> → <span class=\"arab\">صلاة</span>, <span class=\"rm\">selasa</span> → <span class=\"arab\">ثلاث</span>","<span class=\"rm\">z</span>: <span class=\"rm\">zakat</span> → <span class=\"arab\">زكاة</span>, <span class=\"rm\">zat</span> → <span class=\"arab\">ذات</span>, <span class=\"rm\">zohor</span> → <span class=\"arab\">ظهر</span>"]},{"j":"h","t":"Dua huruf Rumi, satu huruf Jawi (digraf)"},{"j":"l","t":["<span class=\"rm\">kh</span> → <span class=\"arab\">خ</span>: <span class=\"rm\">khemah</span> → <span class=\"arab\">خيمه</span>","<span class=\"rm\">gh</span> → <span class=\"arab\">غ</span>: <span class=\"rm\">ghaib</span> → <span class=\"arab\">غيب</span>","<span class=\"rm\">ng</span> → <span class=\"arab\">ڠ</span>: <span class=\"rm\">bunga</span> → <span class=\"arab\">بوڠا</span>","<span class=\"rm\">ny</span> → <span class=\"arab\">ڽ</span>: <span class=\"rm\">nyamuk</span> → <span class=\"arab\">ڽاموق</span>","<span class=\"rm\">sy</span> → <span class=\"arab\">ش</span>: <span class=\"rm\">syukur</span> → <span class=\"arab\">شكور</span>"]}],"glosari":[["Konsonan","Huruf selain vokal."],["Digraf","Dua huruf Rumi yang mewakili satu bunyi."],["Padanan","Huruf yang sama bunyinya."]]},{"id":"t1-jawi-kafa-5","nama":"Suku kata terbuka vokal a","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Apakah suku kata terbuka?"},{"j":"p","t":"{{Suku kata terbuka}} ialah suku kata yang berakhir dengan vokal. Pola <span class=\"rm\">KV</span>: konsonan + vokal."},{"j":"h","t":"Vokal a"},{"j":"p","t":"Vokal <span class=\"rm\">a</span> ditulis dengan <span class=\"arab\">ا</span>: <span class=\"rm\">ba</span> <span class=\"arab\">با</span>, <span class=\"rm\">da</span> <span class=\"arab\">دا</span>, <span class=\"rm\">ma</span> <span class=\"arab\">ما</span>."},{"j":"h","t":"Contoh perkataan"},{"j":"l","t":["<span class=\"rm\">dada</span> → <span class=\"arab\">دادا</span>","<span class=\"rm\">jala</span> → <span class=\"arab\">جالا</span>","<span class=\"rm\">mara</span> → <span class=\"arab\">مارا</span>","<span class=\"rm\">mama</span> → <span class=\"arab\">ماما</span>","<span class=\"rm\">sawa</span> → <span class=\"arab\">ساوا</span>","<span class=\"rm\">cara</span> → <span class=\"arab\">چارا</span>","<span class=\"rm\">paya</span> → <span class=\"arab\">ڤايا</span>"]}],"glosari":[["Suku kata","Bahagian perkataan yang disebut dengan satu hembusan."],["Suku kata terbuka","Suku kata yang berakhir dengan vokal."],["Pola <span class=\"rm\">KV</span>","Konsonan diikuti vokal."]]},{"id":"t1-jawi-kafa-6","nama":"Suku kata terbuka e pepet, o, u, i dan e taling","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Vokal e pepet"},{"j":"p","t":"Vokal <span class=\"rm\">e</span> pepet tidak ditulis: <span class=\"rm\">peta</span> → <span class=\"arab\">ڤتا</span>, <span class=\"rm\">kera</span> → <span class=\"arab\">كرا</span>, <span class=\"rm\">cela</span> → <span class=\"arab\">چلا</span>, <span class=\"rm\">teka</span> → <span class=\"arab\">تكا</span>."},{"j":"h","t":"Vokal o dan u"},{"j":"p","t":"Kedua-duanya ditulis dengan <span class=\"arab\">و</span>: <span class=\"rm\">buku</span> → <span class=\"arab\">بوكو</span>, <span class=\"rm\">guru</span> → <span class=\"arab\">ݢورو</span>, <span class=\"rm\">susu</span> → <span class=\"arab\">سوسو</span>, <span class=\"rm\">kuku</span> → <span class=\"arab\">كوكو</span>, <span class=\"rm\">judo</span> → <span class=\"arab\">جودو</span>."},{"j":"h","t":"Vokal i dan e taling"},{"j":"p","t":"Kedua-duanya ditulis dengan <span class=\"arab\">ي</span>: <span class=\"rm\">titi</span> → <span class=\"arab\">تيتي</span>, <span class=\"rm\">gigi</span> → <span class=\"arab\">ݢيݢي</span>, <span class=\"rm\">siri</span> → <span class=\"arab\">سيري</span>, <span class=\"rm\">beca</span> → <span class=\"arab\">بيچا</span>."}],"glosari":[["Vokal <span class=\"rm\">o</span>","Bunyi <span class=\"rm\">o</span> seperti dalam <span class=\"rm\">soto</span>."],["Vokal <span class=\"rm\">u</span>","Bunyi <span class=\"rm\">u</span> seperti dalam <span class=\"rm\">buku</span>."],["Vokal <span class=\"rm\">i</span>","Bunyi <span class=\"rm\">i</span> seperti dalam <span class=\"rm\">gigi</span>."]]},{"id":"t1-jawi-kafa-7","nama":"Suku kata tertutup vokal a","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Apakah suku kata tertutup?"},{"j":"p","t":"{{Suku kata tertutup}} ialah suku kata yang berakhir dengan konsonan. Pola <span class=\"rm\">KVK</span>: konsonan + vokal + konsonan."},{"j":"h","t":"Vokal a dalam suku kata tertutup"},{"j":"p","t":"Vokal <span class=\"rm\">a</span> biasanya tidak ditulis dengan <span class=\"arab\">ا</span> dalam suku kata tertutup: <span class=\"rm\">jam</span> → <span class=\"arab\">جم</span>, <span class=\"rm\">cat</span> → <span class=\"arab\">چت</span>, <span class=\"rm\">bas</span> → <span class=\"arab\">بس</span>, <span class=\"rm\">tar</span> → <span class=\"arab\">تر</span>."},{"j":"h","t":"Contoh perkataan"},{"j":"l","t":["<span class=\"rm\">bantu</span> → <span class=\"arab\">بنتو</span>","<span class=\"rm\">tanda</span> → <span class=\"arab\">تندا</span>","<span class=\"rm\">jampi</span> → <span class=\"arab\">جمڤي</span>","<span class=\"rm\">camca</span> → <span class=\"arab\">چمچا</span>","<span class=\"rm\">kebab</span> → <span class=\"arab\">كباب</span>","<span class=\"rm\">butang</span> → <span class=\"arab\">بوتڠ</span>","<span class=\"rm\">tajam</span> → <span class=\"arab\">تاجم</span>","<span class=\"rm\">orang</span> → <span class=\"arab\">اورڠ</span>","<span class=\"rm\">tangan</span> → <span class=\"arab\">تاڠن</span>"]}],"glosari":[["Suku kata tertutup","Suku kata yang berakhir dengan konsonan."],["Pola <span class=\"rm\">KVK</span>","Konsonan, vokal, konsonan."]]},{"id":"t1-jawi-kafa-8","nama":"Suku kata tertutup e pepet","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"E pepet dalam suku kata tertutup"},{"j":"p","t":"Vokal <span class=\"rm\">e</span> pepet juga tidak ditulis dalam suku kata tertutup: <span class=\"rm\">ber</span> → <span class=\"arab\">بر</span>, <span class=\"rm\">ter</span> → <span class=\"arab\">تر</span>, <span class=\"rm\">den</span> → <span class=\"arab\">دن</span>, <span class=\"rm\">cem</span> → <span class=\"arab\">چم</span>."},{"j":"h","t":"Contoh perkataan"},{"j":"l","t":["<span class=\"rm\">benci</span> → <span class=\"arab\">بنچي</span>","<span class=\"rm\">denda</span> → <span class=\"arab\">دندا</span>","<span class=\"rm\">kentang</span> → <span class=\"arab\">كنتڠ</span>","<span class=\"rm\">rendah</span> → <span class=\"arab\">رنده</span>","<span class=\"rm\">pernah</span> → <span class=\"arab\">ڤرنه</span>","<span class=\"rm\">lembut</span> → <span class=\"arab\">لمبوت</span>","<span class=\"rm\">mesra</span> → <span class=\"arab\">مسرا</span>","<span class=\"rm\">gembira</span> → <span class=\"arab\">ݢمبيرا</span>","<span class=\"rm\">bendera</span> → <span class=\"arab\">بنديرا</span>","<span class=\"rm\">jendela</span> → <span class=\"arab\">جنديلا</span>"]},{"j":"h","t":"Ingat"},{"j":"p","t":"Ejaan suku kata tertutup <span class=\"rm\">e</span> pepet dan vokal <span class=\"rm\">a</span> adalah sama dalam Jawi; bunyinya sahaja yang berbeza."}],"glosari":[["<span class=\"rm\">E</span> pepet","Bunyi <span class=\"rm\">e</span> seperti dalam <span class=\"rm\">benci</span>."],["Ejaan","Cara menulis perkataan."]]},{"id":"t1-jawi-kafa-9","nama":"Ulang kaji Jawi Tahun 1","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Ringkasan"},{"j":"l","t":["Huruf Jawi ada 37 huruf dan ditulis dari kanan ke kiri","Huruf tambahan Melayu: <span class=\"arab\">چ ڠ ڤ ݢ ۏ ڽ</span>","Vokal: <span c